' Métadonneur
User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4
User --> UC5

' Expert (hérite des cas du métadonneur)
Expert --> UC1
Expert --> UC2
Expert --> UC3
Expert --> UC4
Expert --> UC5

' Expert spécifique
Expert --> UC11
Expert --> UC15
Expert --> UC16
Expert --> UC17
